    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pz7g](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pz7g) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Mar 16 2025 33km SE of Dulecha. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 9.3942 longitude 40.2111. It impacted 207052 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
